is significantly funnier,

00:39:50.100 --> 00:39:51.040
personally.

00:39:51.040 --> 00:39:54.150
Family Guy did not make
my list either, though.

00:39:54.150 --> 00:39:56.670
Because they just didn't,
they got crowded out

00:39:56.670 --> 00:39:59.470
by things that were more
influential and more impactful.

00:40:00.660 --> 00:40:05.590
- I'm gonna go with my number eight.

00:40:05.590 --> 00:40:09.990
Flight of the Conchords,
season one aired in 2007.

00:40:11.930 --> 00:40:15.900
And I felt like I had
to put it on the list

00:40:15.900 --> 00:40:18.490
