00:40:51.503 --> 00:40:54.268
with anything we're developing,

00:40:54.268 --> 00:40:57.679
versus contrasted with it.

00:40:57.679 --> 00:40:59.293
- Well and thankfully,

00:41:00.626 --> 00:41:03.750
they only did it for two seasons.

00:41:03.750 --> 00:41:06.090
