00:41:06.090 --> 00:41:09.390
- I'll say that, I think
one of the best things

00:41:09.390 --> 00:41:10.710
that ever happened to us is the fact

00:41:10.710 --> 00:41:11.920
that Flight of the Conchords decided

00:41:11.920 --> 00:41:14.160
to do things on their own. (chuckles)

00:41:14.160 --> 00:41:18.395
You know, 'cause I just think,
and they are playing again.

