Gadget, The Jetsons,

01:20:25.896 --> 01:20:28.990
A-Team, Small Wonder.

01:20:28.990 --> 01:20:30.403
Watched that after school.

01:20:33.230 --> 01:20:36.950
Small Wonder, a robot,
in 2007 she was a nurse

01:20:36.950 --> 01:20:39.570
in Boulder Community Hospital
