01:20:39.570 --> 01:20:42.580
I tried to find what
she's up to now, Vicki.

01:20:42.580 --> 01:20:44.140
Had a crush on Vicki.
- Hmm.

01:20:44.140 --> 01:20:46.513
- Punky Brewster, also had a crush on her.

01:20:47.490 --> 01:20:48.980
The Ellen DeGeneres Show.

01:20:48.980 --> 01:20:51.600
That almost made my list.
