01:20:57.493 --> 01:20:58.640
- Of course now I got
all types of lesbians

01:20:58.640 --> 01:20:59.740
coming into my home.
- That's right.

01:20:59.740 --> 01:21:01.260
- I love it.
- Yep.

01:21:01.260 --> 01:21:03.193
- But I mean, she was the first one.

01:21:04.145 --> 01:21:06.210
- I didn't watch it.

01:21:06.210 --> 01:21:07.454
- Well even now.

01:21:07.454 --> 01:21:10.960
I mean not the sitcom, the
show that's still on now.

01:21:10.960 --> 01:21:12.740
- Oh.
- Yeah.

01:21:12.740 --> 01:21:15.170
- I thought you were
talking about the sitcom.

01:21:15.170 --> 01:21:17.427
- It's been on a long time now.

01:21:17.427 --> 01:21:21.060
Letterman, The Cosby Show,
The Wire, Breaking Bad

01:21:21.060 --> 01:21:23.360
and Mad Men, some of my
favorite television shows.

01:21:23.360 --> 01:21:25.560
- That's when you get into
the best television shows

01:21:25.560 --> 01:21:27.530
of all time and I'd definitely
be breaking those out.

01:21:27.530 --> 01:21:28.520
- And The Price Is Right.

01:21:28.520 --> 01:21:31.371
- The only thing on my honorable mention

01:21:31.371 --> 01:21:34.190
